	quest.0ED64547FC4F72EE.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to my Cobblemon One Block!"
		"This is a mostly vanilla-plus experience, where everything is accessible through sifting. However, there are also gyms, which you can challenge using the Radical Trainers mod—either through the Shiny Pearl or Radical Red storylines."
		""
		"I highly recommend trying this, as it adds a competitive edge along with a true Cobblemon sense of progression."
		""
		"The One Block is the standard One Block experience, so make the most of every stage. As you may know, they don’t stick around for very long! But don’t worry—thanks to additional mods, everything remains accessible as you progress."
		""
		"Enjoy your journey, and good luck becoming the ultimate trainer!"
	]
	quest.0ED64547FC4F72EE.title: "Information"
	quest.0EFF1AA37772156B.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.farm.desc.sink}"]
	quest.0EFF1AA37772156B.quest_subtitle: "{atm9.quest.farm.subt.sink}"
	quest.0EFF1AA37772156B.title: "{atm9.quest.farm.sink}"
	quest.0F16498769DFB3B0.quest_desc: ["This will be the main ingredient for most of this mod's items and blocks."]
	quest.0F9CA8C190C4EB0D.quest_desc: [
		"This mod is packed with content — so much that it now includes every battle gimmick from the Pokémon series, each with its own unique mechanics and methods of unlocking."
		""
		"✅ Mega Evolutions"
		"Includes all 48 Mega Evolutions"
		""
		"Can be configured to only allow battling Megas (not using them)"
		""
		"Cosmetic customization for Mega Bracelets"
		""
		"Emissive textures for a more dynamic visual effect"
		""
		"Full stat and ability changes when a Pokémon Mega Evolves"
		""
		"Riding support for Megas"
		""
		"Curios/Trinkets compatibility for added customization"
		""
		"✅ Other Major Gimmicks Included"
		"Primal Reversions (Groudon and Kyogre)"
		""
		"Z-Moves system fully integrated"
		""
		"Dynamaxing and Gigantamaxing supported"
		""
		"Tera Types added with full mechanics"
		""
		"Ultra Burst (Necrozma transformation mechanic)"
		""
		"Ultra Necrozma included"
		""
		"All fusion Pokémon (like Kyurem, Calyrex forms, etc.)"
		""
		"Additional Notes:"
		"Each gimmick has its own method of unlocking, encouraging exploration and variety."
		""
		"The mod supports various playstyles and configs, so you can tailor the experience to how challenging or immersive you want it to be."
		""
		"With so many features, this mod massively expands your gameplay options — perfect for players looking for a deep, competitive, and content-rich experience."
	]
	quest.0F9CA8C190C4EB0D.title: "MegaShowDown"
	quest.0FEAD3CA2CC4A8B1.title: "{atm9.quest.SG.tier3SGC}"
	quest.107DB8EA17121663.quest_desc: [
		"\"Candy shop? Caaandy shop? I think that’s a song... maybe. Doesn’t matter.\""
		"What does matter is — I got sweets. Special sweets. Rare. Exotic. Probably magical. Possibly expired. Who can say?"
		""
		"Some of these might even be safe for Pokémon! Or... not."
		"Check the packaging before you give it to one, yeah? I’m like... 55% sure it’s fine. Solid odds, really."
		""
		"So — want some? They’re sugary. They’re mysterious."
		"They’re definitely candy. Probably."
	]
	quest.107DB8EA17121663.title: "Candy Shop Candy Shop"
	quest.1086C6450728C3B4.quest_desc: ["&cCurrently this item has no uses."]
