	quest.495B0CC178B4CFA9.quest_desc: ["The &n&5Funnel&r can import or export items from connected inventories."]
	quest.4A1C17F349C72415.quest_desc: ["Ah yes, the Oak Sieve—back again. If you’ve used this mod before, you probably know what’s coming. But if not, here’s the deal: this block lets you sift materials through it, giving you a chance to obtain useful resources. In this case, it’ll help you gather most of the cobblestone-based items you'll need to move forward."]
