	quest.54288F6026AB4C34.quest_desc: [
		"\"Oho! What's this...?\""
		"Look at these shiny stones! Aren’t they glorious? So shiny. All of them. Every last one."
		"...Just, uh—don’t look too closely. Best to admire from a distance, yeah?"
	]
	quest.54288F6026AB4C34.title: "Rare Shiny Rocks"
	quest.54EA80F374440D7C.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.storage.desc.scanner}"]
	quest.54EA80F374440D7C.quest_subtitle: "{atm9.quest.storage.subt.scanner}"
	quest.54EA80F374440D7C.title: "{atm9.quest.storage.scanner}"
	quest.54EC1C7FC1DA9107.quest_desc: [
		"The &n&5Adjustable Chain Drive&r works similar to the normal Chain Drive when it has no redstone signal."
		""
		"When you apply a redstone signal and it is the block receiving the rotational force, it will double the speed for the connected Chain Drives."
		""
		"When you apply a redstone signal and it is not the block receiving the rotational force, it will half the speed for the connected Chain Drives."
	]
	quest.550BC38EA1D44C2B.quest_desc: [
		"\"Ahhh, hello there, traveler...\""
		"Most folks call me a trader — but I prefer the term entrepreneur, personally. Has a nicer ring to it, don't you think?"
		""
		"Now then, let's get to business. You see, I have a bit of an obsession... relic coins. Glorious, shiny, ancient things! I love them. I need them. And lucky you — I've got wares. Strange wares. Rare wares. Magical? Maybe. Cursed? Who's to say."
		""
		"You can spend your precious relic coins right here. But fair warning:"
		"You're not guaranteed to get what you want."
		"You might get something completely different."
		"You might get nothing at all."
		""
		"No refunds. No complaints. No backsies."
		"Deal with it."
		""
		"Now then... care to try your luck?"
	]
	quest.550BC38EA1D44C2B.title: "Who is this..."
	quest.5611C20E8B58448B.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.storage.desc.filter}"]
	quest.5611C20E8B58448B.title: "{atm9.quest.storage.rf_filter}"
	quest.561833E63459CDFC.quest_desc: ["You can use hammers to crush blocks into other materials—for example, cobblestone into gravel, gravel into sand, and sand into dust. The better the hammer, the longer it will last."]
	quest.56194F5EEDAE9181.quest_desc: ["The converter block converts villagers to zombie villagers and cures them afterwards, enabling the player that placed the block better trades from the cured villager. This block needs a golden apple, any type of potion of weakness and the villager to convert. This process takes approximately five minutes."]
	quest.563CFA1EF74E52E9.quest_desc: ["{atm9.quest.storage.desc.sophisticated}"]
